# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfiles COPY. Without this the host's
# node_modules (macOS-built, symlinked into .pnpm) overlay the container install
# and every build ships the whole Obsidian vault as context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.obsidian
.env*
**/.env*
00-index
10-product
20-architecture
30-domain
40-backend
50-clients
60-integrations
70-algorithms
80-infrastructure
90-quality
95-delivery
99-decisions
docs
codegraph
apps/driver-app
apps/web/test-results
**/test-results
system-probe-report.json
